---
import ResourceLayout from "../layouts/ResourceLayout.astro";
const sections = [{"id": "information-we-handle", "label": "Information we handle"}, {"id": "how-images-are-used", "label": "How images are used"}, {"id": "retention-and-deletion", "label": "Retention and deletion"}, {"id": "security-and-providers", "label": "Security and providers"}, {"id": "your-choices", "label": "Your choices"}, {"id": "changes-and-contact", "label": "Changes and contact"}];
---
<ResourceLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How Growx Chitra handles WhatsApp messages, product images and business information." summary="What information we process, why we need it, and how you can ask us to delete it." sections={sections} policy>
<h2 id="information-we-handle">Information we handle</h2><p>When you message Growx Chitra on WhatsApp, we process your phone number, message details, product images, business preferences and service activity so we can provide the image workflow, support, account controls and payment records.</p>
    <h2 id="how-images-are-used">How images are used</h2><p>Images are processed to prepare product photography and deliver it back to you. Images are stored privately and are not made publicly accessible. We do not use them to identify people or to create face swaps or deepfakes. Images may be sent to service providers needed to run the workflow, such as WhatsApp and image-processing providers.</p>
    <h2 id="retention-and-deletion">Retention and deletion</h2><p>Current default retention is 30 days for original and generated images, 24 hours for blocked images, and 30 days for minimal safety-event records. Business logos remain until replaced, removed or deleted with the account. You can request deletion in WhatsApp using “DELETE MY DATA” and confirm with “CONFIRM DELETE”. Some payment and financial records may be retained where needed for reconciliation or legal obligations.</p>
    <h2 id="security-and-providers">Security and providers</h2><p>We use access controls and private storage for product images. We share only the information needed with service providers that help operate the service. No storage system or transmission can be guaranteed completely secure.</p>
    <h2 id="your-choices">Your choices</h2><p>You may stop using the service, remove a saved logo, or request account deletion through WhatsApp. Contact support for privacy questions or to ask about information associated with your account.</p>
    <h2 id="changes-and-contact">Changes and contact</h2><p>We may update this notice as the service changes. The current version will be published here. For questions, visit <a href="/support">Support</a>.</p>
</ResourceLayout>
